subckt Main (VSS vg)
C1 (net0 vg) capacitor c=1p
C2 (net0 VSS) capacitor c=1p
I1 (VSS net0) isource dc=100u
R1 (vg net1) resistor r=1k
R2 (net0 VSS) resistor r=1k
V1 (net1 VSS) vsource dc=1.8
